als</a><a data-w-id=\"5981bf90-84e7-96f6-6983-121ab8e52207\" href=\"/coming-soon\" class=\"dropdown-link-7 w-dropdown-link\">Podcast</a><a data-w-id=\"5981bf90-84e7-96f6-6983-121ab8e52209\" href=\"/blogs\" class=\"dropdown-link-7 w-dropdown-link\">Blog</a></nav></div><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"nav_link w-inline-block\"><div class=\"text-block-6\">CONTACT US</div><div class=\"link_line\" style=\"transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px) scale3d(0, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg, 0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;\"></div></a></div></div></nav><a href=\"http://wa.me/971522732589\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link-block-2 w-inline-block\"><div class=\"text-block-11\">Whatsapp</div></a><div class=\"nav_button w-nav-button\"><div class=\"nav_button-inner\"><div class=\"nav_button-line is-top\"></div><div class=\"nav_button-line is-middle\"></div><div class=\"nav_button-line is-bottom\"></div></div></div></div></div></div><main class=\"main-wrapper\"><section data-w-id=\"dac3a0ad-1bc4-f50d-4480-37c180ea2f7d\" class=\"section is-about-hero\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"about-hero_wrap\"><div class=\"max-width-700\"><h1 class=\"heading-style-h1\"> </h1></div><div class=\"about-visual_wrap\"><div class=\"video_box\"><div class=\"video_bg\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/695f5a96126e8b2be6ba45b8_Spanish%20copy%204.png\" loading=\"eager\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1275px) 100vw, 1275px, 100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/695f5a96126e8b2be6ba45b8_Spanish%20copy%204-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/695f5a96126e8b2be6ba45b8_Spanish%20copy%204-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/695f5a96126e8b2be6ba45b8_Spanish%20copy%204-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/695f5a96126e8b2be6ba45b8_Spanish%20copy%204.png 1275w\" alt=\"\" class=\"parallax-img is-full\" style=\"will-change: transform; transform: translate3d(0px, 0%, 0px) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg, 0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"w-layout-vflex flex-center\"><div class=\"max-width-800\"><p><strong>Our Spanish language program offers an engaging and effective learning experience for students interested in mastering one of the world’s most widely spoken languages. The curriculum emphasizes practical communication skills, enabling learners to speak, understand, and interact confidently.</strong></p></div></div></div></div><section class=\"section is-history\"><div class=\"parallax-wrap\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/69222dd584d9004081d58cd4_uhasfilkn.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"239.96875px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/69222dd584d9004081d58cd4_uhasfilkn-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/69222dd584d9004081d58cd4_uhasfilkn-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/69222dd584d9004081d58cd4_uhasfilkn-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/69222dd584d9004081d58cd4_uhasfilkn.jpg 1500w\" alt=\"\" class=\"parallax-img\" style=\"will-change: transform; transform: translate3d(0px, 0%, 0px) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg, 0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;\"><div class=\"parallax-overlay is-full\"></div></div><div class=\"z-index-2\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"wrap_flex is-align-top\"><div class=\"max-width-440\"></div><div class=\"max-width-440 is-full-responsive\"></div><div class=\"max-width-440\"><h2><span style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, 0.5em, 0px) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg, 0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;\" class=\"is-word is-1\">What You Will Learn</span></h2></div><div class=\"max-width-440 is-full-responsive\"><div class=\"text-color-lightgrey\"><p><strong class=\"bold-text-3\">- Speak Spanish comfortably in daily, travel, and professional situations.<br><br>- Improve listening skills using realistic dialogues and audio materials.<br><br>- Master reading and writing at different levels.<br><br>- Learn grammar progressively with clear explanations.<br><br>- Build a rich vocabulary that improves communication fluency.</strong></p></div></div></div></div></div></section></section><section class=\"section background-color-black\"><div data-w-id=\"2868c035-7512-59ff-d96d-180201f9bdc9\" class=\"container-large\"></div><section class=\"section background-color-black\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div class=\"faqs_wrap\"><div class=\"div-block-2\"><div class=\"w-layout-vflex max-width-440\"><div class=\"margin-bottom-16\"><h2 class=\"is-word is-1\">FAQ</h2></div></div></div><ul role=\"list\" class=\"faqs_list\"><li data-w-id=\"ab1a3d19-977b-898b-3bc1-40074489c468\" class=\"faqs_item\"><div class=\"faqs_head\"><p class=\"text-size-medium text-weight-medium\">What type of learning materials are used in the Spanish language courses?</p><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/68fd63e9503df62b019b5ca9_faq-arrow.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-24\"></div><div class=\"faqs_body\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 0px;\"><div class=\"margin-top-8\"><div class=\"text-color-lightgrey\"><div class=\"text-rich-text w-richtext\"><p>We use up-to-date learning materials that are regularly reviewed and improved to match international educational standards. These materials include modern textbooks, digital resources, audio lessons, interactive activities, and real-life dialogues that help students practice the language naturally. The engaging activities are designed to make learning enjoyable while strengthening key skills such as vocabulary, grammar, reading comprehension, and conversational fluency.</p></div></div></div></div></li><li data-w-id=\"ab1a3d19-977b-898b-3bc1-40074489c468\" class=\"faqs_item\"><div class=\"faqs_head\"><p class=\"text-size-medium text-weight-medium\">Who teaches the Spanish courses, and do the instructors have experience with Arabic-speaking students?</p><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/68fd63e9503df62b019b5ca9_faq-arrow.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-24\"></div><div class=\"faqs_body\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 0px;\"><div class=\"margin-top-8\"><div class=\"text-color-lightgrey\"><div class=\"text-rich-text w-richtext\"><p>Our Spanish courses are taught by professional instructors who specialize in teaching Spanish specifically to Arabic-speaking learners. They understand the linguistic challenges Arabic speakers face when learning Spanish and tailor their teaching methods accordingly. Their experience, cultural awareness, and precise explanations help students learn faster, avoid common mistakes, and develop confidence in both spoken and written Spanish.</p></div></div></div></div></li><li data-w-id=\"ab1a3d19-977b-898b-3bc1-40074489c468\" class=\"faqs_item\"><div class=\"faqs_head\"><p class=\"text-size-medium text-weight-medium\">How large are the class sizes, and why do you prefer small groups?</p><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/68fd63e9503df62b019b5ca9_faq-arrow.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-24\"></div><div class=\"faqs_body\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 0px;\"><div class=\"margin-top-8\"><div class=\"text-color-lightgrey\"><div class=\"text-rich-text w-richtext\"><p>We intentionally keep our class sizes small to ensure better interaction, personalized attention, and measurable progress. Small groups create a more comfortable environment for students to speak, ask questions, and practice the language without hesitation. This setup also allows instructors to focus on each student’s strengths and challenges, resulting in faster improvement and a more engaging learning experience overall.</p></div></div></div></div></li><li data-w-id=\"ab1a3d19-977b-898b-3bc1-40074489c468\" class=\"faqs_item\"><div class=\"faqs_head\"><p class=\"text-size-medium text-weight-medium\">What levels do you offer, and is the program suitable for complete beginners?</p><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/68fd63e9503df62b019b5ca9_faq-arrow.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-24\"></div><div class=\"faqs_body\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 0px;\"><div class=\"margin-top-8\"><div class=\"text-color-lightgrey\"><div class=\"text-rich-text w-richtext\"><p>Yes, our Spanish program is suitable for all learners, including complete beginners. We offer levels from <strong>A1 to C1</strong>, following a structured progression that develops all language skills step-by-step. Students start with basic vocabulary and simple phrases at the beginner levels, and gradually move toward advanced grammar, complex conversations, and strong reading and writing skills. Each level includes clear objectives, interactive practice, and continuous assessment to ensure consistent improvement.</p></div></div></div></div></li><li data-w-id=\"ab1a3d19-977b-898b-3bc1-40074489c468\" class=\"faqs_item\"><div class=\"faqs_head\"><p class=\"text-size-medium text-weight-medium\">Do you support students who wish to study in Spanish-speaking countries?</p><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/68fd63e9503df62b019b5ca9_faq-arrow.svg\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-24\"></div><div class=\"faqs_body\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 0px;\"><div class=\"margin-top-8\"><div class=\"text-color-lightgrey\"><div class=\"text-rich-text w-richtext\"><p>Absolutely. We provide full guidance for students planning to pursue their studies in Spain or Latin American countries. This includes information on university admission requirements, language certificates such as DELE or SIELE, academic preparation, and cultural orientation to help students adapt easily. Whether students aim to study medicine, engineering, business, or language programs, we assist them throughout the process to ensure a smooth transition and successful academic journey abroad.</p></div></div></div></div></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><h1 class=\"heading-style-h1\"> </h1><h1><span class=\"is-word\">Contact Us</span></h1><p class=\"paragraph-4\">Ready to start? Fill out the form below:</p><a data-w-id=\"7fdb8628-72a9-5727-2c79-3ac63b03bb9c\" href=\"#\" class=\"button-2 w-button\">Fill the form</a></div></section></section><section data-w-id=\"4500f34f-ad71-c737-340f-a39b6520a855\" class=\"section is-bottom-cta\"><div class=\"container-large\"><div data-w-id=\"4500f34f-ad71-c737-340f-a39b6520a857\" class=\"bottom-cta_wrap\"><div class=\"max-width-700\"><h2 class=\"heading-4\"><span class=\"is-word is-1\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translate3d(0px, 0.5em, 0px) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg, 0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;\">ARE YOU Ready ?</span> <br></h2></div><div class=\"bottom-cta_box\" style=\"will-change: transform; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px) scale3d(2.5, 2.5, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg, 0deg); transform-style: preserve-3d;\"><div class=\"video_bg\"><div class=\"video_bg_overlay\"></div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/68fd63e9503df62b019b5d1a_reading-room.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 307px\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/68fd63e9503df62b019b5d1a_reading-room-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68fd63e9503df62b019b5c75/68fd63e9503df62b019b5d1a_reading-room.webp 640w\" alt=\"Bright, spacious reading room with tall windows, rows of study desks, and people working quietly.\" class=\"img-cover\"></div></div><div class=\"max-wi